# Kept local, not published. The Store association is written by Visual Studio's
# "Associate App with the Store" and carries the publisher id and reserved names;
# the .wapproj still names it, and a missing <None> item does not break the build.
src/DeskFlipInstallerMSIX/Package.StoreAssociation.xml

